# Escape exiles five *other* cards from the graveyard (CR 702.138a). On turn 5 the graveyard holds Phlage (cast from hand on
# turn 1 and sacrificed) and only two others, the Arid Mesas cracked on turns 1 and 3, while two Gold Pans' Treasures stand
# untapped beside lands and Moxen that cover {R}{R}{W}{W}. A Treasure is a token: sacrificed for mana it puts no card into the
# graveyard (CR 111.1, 108.2b), so its mana ability cannot feed the exile cost, and the escape is not offered. This is the position
# a booster pod's bot seat stalled in (issue #2209): offered the escape, it announced it, the cast was taken back, and it announced
# it again, thousands of times a turn, until the event ran out of time.

[Bot1 Deck]
Arid Mesa
